00:01:44.404 --> 00:01:45.505
I'M SORRY, THAT'S SOMETHING THAT
GEORGE --

00:01:45.505 --> 00:01:46.906
&gt;&gt; I LOVE THAT SHE'S A POET.
&gt;&gt; THIS IS THE TRUTH THAT THEY

00:01:46.906 --> 00:01:48.241
DON'T WANT YOU TO KNOW.
I LOVE THAT HE LOVES TO READ THE

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:49.909
DSM TO FIND OUT WHAT'S WRONG MY
