00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:52.679
&gt;&gt; NARCISSIST, THERE IT IS.
I LOVE THAT WHEN ANN COULTER SET

00:01:52.679 --> 00:01:55.381
US UP, SHE THOUGHT, THESE TWO
ARE PERFECT FOR EACH OTHER."

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:58.485
&gt;&gt; I LOVE THAT WE AGREE ON THE
BIG STUFF LIKE SMALL GOVERNMENT

00:01:58.485 --> 00:02:03.923 align:start size:94% position:6%
