00:02:03.923 --> 00:02:06.426
&gt;&gt; AND I KNOW I'M NOT SUPPOSED
TO BUT I EVEN LOVE OUR FIGHTS.

00:02:06.426 --> 00:02:08.461 size:81% position:41%
&gt;&gt; I FEEL BAD FOR YOU.
&gt;&gt; YOU ARE THE ONE WHO

00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:10.763 size:88% position:44%
