WHERE IS YOUR BLUE CHECK,

00:02:15.869 --> 00:02:18.905 align:start size:94% position:6%
GEORGE?
&gt;&gt; -- HAS JUST ANNOUNCED

00:02:18.905 --> 00:02:25.745
