&gt;&gt; OKAY, SO DO YOU HAVE WHAT YOU

00:02:25.745 --> 00:02:28.748 align:start size:94% position:6%
NEED FOR YOUR PIECE?
&gt;&gt; PIECE?

00:02:28.748 --> 00:02:31.618 align:start size:94% position:6%
OH, I'M NOT A REPORTER.
